solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SATB2</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">PAX8</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Uroplakin-2</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SMAD4</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Other features</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong>Appendiceal mucinous neoplasm and mucinous adenocarcinoma</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Often&nbsp;&minus; or weak/focal&nbsp;+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">+<sup>a</sup> (Diffuse)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Retained/loss (loss in 12&ndash;27% of appendiceal adenocarcinomas)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">MUC2 typically +/strong</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Ovarian mucinous neoplasm</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Often &minus;&nbsp;or&nbsp;+</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;<sup>a</sup></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+<sup>a</sup></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">May be focal and weak</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Retained</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Primary: </span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;</span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&nbsp;130&nbsp;mm unless bilateral or has surface nodules</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Metastatic: &lt;&nbsp;130&nbsp;mm unless unilateral</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong>Pancreatobiliary mucinous neoplasm</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">+ (Strong)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Variable, often&nbsp;&minus; or weak&nbsp;+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">+ [Intestinal]</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">[Excludes appendiceal and colorectal origin]</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Loss<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">(~50% of invasive cases)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">MUC1 may be +, mainly invasive</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Colorectal (mucinous) adenocarcinoma</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Often&nbsp;&minus; or focal&nbsp;+</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+ (Diffuse, strong)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+<sup>a</sup></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Retained/loss (loss in ~20%)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">More cytological atypia</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">MUC2 typically +/strong</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong>Gastric mucinous adenocarcinoma</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">+ (Strong)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Variable, &minus;/+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Variable, +/&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Variable, &minus;/+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">Retained</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\">MUC1 may be +</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Urachal mucinous neoplasm</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Focal/weak or &ndash;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+ (Diffuse)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Data lacking for urachus; 49% of bladder adenocarcinoma&nbsp;+</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+<sup>a</sup> Variable, may be weak (supportive)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Retained</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diffuse nuclear staining for &beta;-catenin<sup>a</sup> excludes this diagnosis (compared with colorectum and appendix)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Midline peritoneal tumour</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">MUC1 may be +</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073582;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">MUC2&nbsp;+</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">First line: CK7, CK20, CDX2</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>CK7+/CK20&ndash;: Likely gastric, pancreatic, or ovarian</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>CK7&ndash;/CK20+: Likely colorectal or appendiceal, cannot exclude urachal</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Second line: SATB2, MUC1, MUC2</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>MUC2+ (strong) and SATB2+: Likely appendiceal/colorectal, cannot exclude urachal</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>MUC1+: Gastric or pancreatic</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Confirmatory: PAX8, SMAD4 loss, uroplakin&nbsp;II</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>PAX8+: Ovarian origin</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>SMAD4 loss: Likely pancreatic adenocarcinoma but can also be seen in appendiceal and colorectal adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Uroplakin-2+: Likely urachal mucinous neoplasm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Most helpful immunohistochemistry markers.</p>",
